Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 04:58:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] feat: `brit check-ref-format` answering through its exit
 code

Validates a reference name like `git check-ref-format`: at least two components
unless `--allow-onelevel`, and gitoxide's partial-name rules otherwise. It needs no
repository and prints nothing; the journey compares exit codes with Git for valid
and invalid names, including the build-note ref names the workspace checks.

